{
  "id": "vocal-cathedral",
  "name": "Vocal Cathedral",
  "description": "Ethereal choral pad morphing through vowels A→E→I→O→U with cathedral reverb.",
  "group": "Vocal Synthesis",
  "graph": {
    "modules": [
      {
        "id": "ctrl-1",
        "type": "control",
        "name": "Control",
        "position": { "x": 0, "y": 0 },
        "params": {
          "cv": 0,
          "cvMode": "unipolar",
          "velocity": 1,
          "midiVelocity": true,
          "gate": 0,
          "glide": 0.02,
          "voices": 4
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "supersaw-1",
        "type": "supersaw",
        "name": "Supersaw",
        "position": { "x": 0, "y": 0 },
        "params": {
          "frequency": 220,
          "detune": 30,
          "mix": 0.9
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "vcf-1",
        "type": "vcf",
        "name": "VCF",
        "position": { "x": 0, "y": 0 },
        "params": {
          "cutoff": 1200,
          "resonance": 0.25,
          "drive": 0.05,
          "envAmount": 0.4,
          "modAmount": 0,
          "keyTrack": 0.5,
          "model": "svf",
          "mode": "lp",
          "slope": 12
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "vca-1",
        "type": "gain",
        "name": "VCA",
        "position": { "x": 0, "y": 0 },
        "params": {
          "gain": 0.8
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "choir-1",
        "type": "choir",
        "name": "Choir",
        "position": { "x": 0, "y": 0 },
        "params": {
          "vowel": 0,
          "rate": 0.15,
          "depth": 0.4,
          "mix": 0.65
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "reverb-1",
        "type": "reverb",
        "name": "Cathedral",
        "position": { "x": 0, "y": 0 },
        "params": {
          "time": 0.92,
          "damp": 0.2,
          "preDelay": 25,
          "mix": 0.45
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "adsr-1",
        "type": "adsr",
        "name": "Amp Env",
        "position": { "x": 0, "y": 0 },
        "params": {
          "attack": 0.8,
          "decay": 0.5,
          "sustain": 0.75,
          "release": 2.0
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "adsr-2",
        "type": "adsr",
        "name": "Filter Env",
        "position": { "x": 0, "y": 0 },
        "params": {
          "attack": 1.2,
          "decay": 0.8,
          "sustain": 0.5,
          "release": 1.5
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "lfo-1",
        "type": "lfo",
        "name": "Vowel LFO",
        "position": { "x": 0, "y": 0 },
        "params": {
          "rate": 0.08,
          "depth": 1.0,
          "offset": 0,
          "shape": "sine",
          "bipolar": true
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "output-1",
        "type": "output",
        "name": "Output",
        "position": { "x": 0, "y": 0 },
        "params": {
          "level": 1
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scope-1",
        "type": "scope",
        "name": "Scope",
        "position": { "x": 0, "y": 0 },
        "params": {
          "time": 1,
          "gain": 1,
          "freeze": false,
          "mode": "scope"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "notes-1",
        "type": "notes",
        "name": "Info",
        "position": { "x": 0, "y": 10 },
        "params": {
          "text": "VOCAL CATHEDRAL\n\nEthereal choral pad that slowly morphs through all vowels (A-E-I-O-U).\n\nSignal: Supersaw → VCF (LP 12dB) → VCA → Choir → Cathedral Reverb → Output\n\n- Supersaw: Rich harmonics (detune 30, mix 0.9)\n- VCF: Shaped by slow filter envelope (ADSR-2)\n- VCA: Controlled by amp envelope (ADSR-1) with slow attack\n- Choir: Vowel swept by very slow LFO (0.08Hz = ~12s cycle)\n- Reverb: Long decay (0.92) with low damping = cathedral ambiance\n\nPlay sustained chords (C3-C5) and listen to the vowels morph.\nTry adjusting LFO rate for faster/slower vowel sweeps."
        }
      }
    ],
    "connections": [
      {
        "from": { "moduleId": "ctrl-1", "portId": "cv-out" },
        "to": { "moduleId": "supersaw-1", "portId": "pitch" },
        "kind": "cv"
      },
      {
        "from": { "moduleId": "ctrl-1", "portId": "gate-out" },
        "to": { "moduleId": "adsr-1", "portId": "gate" },
        "kind": "gate"
      },
      {
        "from": { "moduleId": "ctrl-1", "portId": "gate-out" },
        "to": { "moduleId": "adsr-2", "portId": "gate" },
        "kind": "gate"
      },
      {
        "from": { "moduleId": "supersaw-1", "portId": "out" },
        "to": { "moduleId": "vcf-1", "portId": "in" },
        "kind": "audio"
      },
      {
        "from": { "moduleId": "adsr-2", "portId": "env" },
        "to": { "moduleId": "vcf-1", "portId": "env" },
        "kind": "cv"
      },
      {
        "from": { "moduleId": "vcf-1", "portId": "out" },
        "to": { "moduleId": "vca-1", "portId": "in" },
        "kind": "audio"
      },
      {
        "from": { "moduleId": "adsr-1", "portId": "env" },
        "to": { "moduleId": "vca-1", "portId": "cv" },
        "kind": "cv"
      },
      {
        "from": { "moduleId": "vca-1", "portId": "out" },
        "to": { "moduleId": "choir-1", "portId": "in" },
        "kind": "audio"
      },
      {
        "from": { "moduleId": "lfo-1", "portId": "cv-out" },
        "to": { "moduleId": "choir-1", "portId": "vowel" },
        "kind": "cv"
      },
      {
        "from": { "moduleId": "choir-1", "portId": "out" },
        "to": { "moduleId": "reverb-1", "portId": "in" },
        "kind": "audio"
      },
      {
        "from": { "moduleId": "reverb-1", "portId": "out" },
        "to": { "moduleId": "output-1", "portId": "in" },
        "kind": "audio"
      },
      {
        "from": { "moduleId": "reverb-1", "portId": "out" },
        "to": { "moduleId": "scope-1", "portId": "in-a" },
        "kind": "audio"
      }
    ]
  }
}
